e play through.\nWhat awaits the player throughout the game:\n- Pleasant and realistic immersion.\n- Hints throughout the game.\n- The process of car assembling as close to the reality as possible.", "short_description": "In this simulator, you can try yourself as a car service mechanic. Car service, replacement of wheels and brake pads. Are you ready for the challenge? Start trying this profession!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.termsfeed.com/live/d2ba064a-5e1c-4196-af45-4ed0e8fe2aeb", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Saritasa", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.saritasa.com/3d-development/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "331529188132278"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "760339265466648"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 1, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "544129117901134"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "544129117901134"}, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": [{"start_time": 1683744616, "status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "544129117901134"}]}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "id": "7801280016665475", "version": "0.2.0"}, "id": "4105447833014376", "channel_name": "LIVE"}]}, "is_for_oculus_keys_only": false, "primary_binaries": {"nodes": [{"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_applic